{"id":"1fb693406bd7ef2b3f265fa9f9bf8e575c2d35a0","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1248376","title":"有没有必要搞 2 套 AI","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"wxlwsy","excerpt":"程序员 - @wxlwsy - 已有 gpt100 刀,刚好够用. 寻思要不要开个 cursor","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>已有 gpt100 刀,刚好够用. 寻思要不要开个 cursor</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18174574\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c98db88a0793a8b6839d9d93e09b5835?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jadehare\" data-uid=\"398633\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jadehare\">jadehare</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 14:37:11 +08:00\">22h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己改代码可以用 cursor ，grok 道德比较低，审查应该也不严，有些偷偷摸摸的事情我就用 grok 做。最近 grok 和 cursor 合并了，可以试试看。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18174594\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/598f/e08b/540117_normal.png?m=1775783079\" alt=\"Sundayz\" data-uid=\"540117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sundayz\">Sundayz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 14:39:00 +08:00\">22h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司报销就开，不报销就不开</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18174612\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc4a/fbcc/274199_normal.png?m=1683209705\" alt=\"Building\" data-uid=\"274199\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Building\">Building</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 14:41:38 +08:00\">22h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以后这些 ai 不是电信就是联通，其实没啥区别，迟早进校园摆摊卖 token</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18174810\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fa5e3286a639dc834e69ca783f1f3dd6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"autumncry\" data-uid=\"194443\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/autumncry\">autumncry</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 15:11:38 +08:00\">22h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>咱俩一毛一样，已经有 gpt100 刀，在考虑要不要开个 cursor 的 30 刀，一是可以用 cursor （目前是 vscode+公司自部署 ds4.1 ），二是可以用 grok bot ，还在犹豫中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18174826\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fa5e3286a639dc834e69ca783f1f3dd6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"autumncry\" data-uid=\"194443\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/autumncry\">autumncry</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 15:14:10 +08:00\">22h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我看了 cursor 合并以后的账户，首月 15 刀，续费 30 刀。顺带问一下有没有邀请注册啥的可以便宜点薅羊毛的途径呢？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18175163\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ed563fb491d74eebf02f624f7e99768?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"poxiaohy\" data-uid=\"25781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/poxiaohy\">poxiaohy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 16:04:34 +08:00\">21h 28m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>开两个，一个做指引，高智商，额度少；一个做脏活累活，量大管饱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18175176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/faf66ea6dac74fb7469638282045fa6d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wersero\" data-uid=\"788251\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wersero\">wersero</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 16:07:05 +08:00\">21h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉没必要吧，用一个就够了，我 claude 的 5x 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18176287\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c3/2e3d/54781_normal.png?m=1791891974\" alt=\"trafly\" data-uid=\"54781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trafly\">trafly</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 20:52:09 +08:00\">16h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>小心哦，合并后的 cursor 是默认不带第三方 LLM 额度的，需要购买 API 额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18176824\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c476/56f5/269732_normal.png?m=1788023544\" alt=\"mmdsun\" data-uid=\"269732\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mmdsun\">mmdsun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-14 08:06:32 +08:00\">5h 26m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>X Subscription 那个合并的订阅。定义模型只能选 Gork ，想在 Cursor 用 Opus 模型的慎入，要额外收费</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"已有 gpt100 刀,刚好够用. 寻思要不要开个 cursor 1 jadehare 22h 56m ago 自己改代码可以用 cursor ，grok 道德比较低，审查应该也不严，有些偷偷摸摸的事情我就用 grok 做。最近 grok 和 cursor 合并了，可以试试看。 2 Sundayz 22h 54m ago 公司报销就开，不报销就不开 3 Building 22h 51m ago 以后这些 ai 不是电信就是联通，其实没啥区别，迟早进校园摆摊卖 token 4 autumncry 22h 21m ago 咱俩一毛一样，已经有 gpt100 刀，在考虑要不要开个 cursor 的 30 刀，一是可以用 cursor （目前是 vscode+公司自部署 ds4.1 ），二是可以用 grok bot ，还在犹豫中 5 autumncry 22h 19m ago 我看了 cursor 合并以后的账户，首月 15 刀，续费 30 刀。顺带问一下有没有邀请注册啥的可以便宜点薅羊毛的途径呢？ 6 poxiaohy 21h 28m ago 2 开两个，一个做指引，高智商，额度少；一个做脏活累活，量大管饱 7 wersero 21h 26m ago 感觉没必要吧，用一个就够了，我 claude 的 5x 。 8 trafly 16h 41m ago 小心哦，合并后的 cursor 是默认不带第三方 LLM 额度的，需要购买 API 额度 9 mmdsun 5h 26m ago via iPhone X Subscription 那个合并的订阅。定义模型只能选 Gork ，想在 Cursor 用 Opus 模型的慎入，要额外收费","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T05:33:19.758Z","ok":true}